---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import { withBase } from "../lib/urls";
---

<BaseLayout title="About — BOHUC" description="From a desk at home to an independent leather workshop—the story behind BOHUC.">
  <header class="about-hero page-width">
    <img
      src={withBase("images/about/after.jpg")}
      alt="The BOHUC leather workshop with cutting tables, tools and sewing equipment"
      width="1600"
      height="1200"
      loading="eager"
    />
    <div class="about-hero__content">
      <p class="eyebrow">OUR STORY / 2018 — TODAY</p>
      <h1>A workshop<br />built slowly.</h1>
    </div>
  </header>

  <section class="about-story" aria-label="BOHUC story timeline">
    <div class="page-width">
      <ol class="about-timeline">
        <li class="about-milestone" data-reveal>
          <time class="about-milestone__year" datetime="2018">2018</time>
          <article class="about-milestone__copy">
            <p class="about-milestone__lead">A desk at home, a cutting mat and a borrowed lamp.</p>
            <p>I finished university that year with no plan to make anything. A worn-out wallet I tried to repair turned into months of reading, testing, and learning how leather behaves.</p>
            <p>By the end of the year I had gathered a beginner's set of tools—a round knife, an awl, two needles, and a block of wax—and cleared a desk at home to use them on. For the next few years, every piece was made after work and on weekends.</p>
          </article>
        </li>

        <li class="about-milestone" data-reveal>
          <time class="about-milestone__year" datetime="2021">2021</time>
          <article class="about-milestone__copy">
            <p class="about-milestone__lead">The workshop today—same knife, more room.</p>
            <p>In 2021 I left my job and gave the work all of my week. The desk at home became a proper workshop, with enough space to cut, stitch, finish, and photograph each piece.</p>
          </article>
        </li>

        <li class="about-milestone" data-reveal>
          <span class="about-milestone__year">TODAY</span>
          <article class="about-milestone__copy">
            <p class="about-milestone__lead">Still made slowly, from beginning to end.</p>
            <p>Nothing important about the making has changed: the same measured pace, the same two-needle stitch, and still one pair of hands responsible for every piece.</p>
            <p>BOHUC is an independent workshop, not a production line—and it was never meant to become one.</p>
          </article>
        </li>
      </ol>
    </div>
  </section>

</BaseLayout>
